   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the general business law, in relation to requiring car washes\nto disclose when promotions expire",
    "basePrintNo": "S2464",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S2464-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Add §399-eee, Gen Bus L",
    "lawSection": "General Business Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S2464\n\nSPONSOR: PERSAUD\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the general business law, in relation to requiring car\nwashes to disclose when promotions expire\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nThe purpose of the bill is to increase the transparency between a\ncarwash customer and a carwash business regarding promotion expiration\ndates.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1. Provides for the definition of \"carwash\" and carwash\npromotion disclosure.\n\nSection 2. Provides for effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill provides better communication between carwash employees and\ncustomers regarding carwash promotions. Customers are often given little\nto no information regarding the promotion's expiration date and the\nmonthly fee that shall be deducted from their bank account or credit\ncard. Carwashes and their representatives must present customers with\nlegitimate and accurate information while advertising a promotion to\nprevent future financial strains and surprise bills.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2021-2022: S9259 referred to Consumer Protection\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone noted.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect on the thirtieth day after it shall have\nbecome a law\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
